Charge a card token (v2)
Base URL: https://pay.getpayin.com

Charges a previously vaulted card token server-to-server. Set initiator to merchant for an unattended merchant-initiated (MIT) rebill of the stored credential, or customer for a customer-initiated (CIT) card-on-file charge. A token can only be charged by the integration that created it.

Webhooks: a successful charge fires card_token.charge_succeeded, a declined one fires card_token.charge_failed.

Authentication: the same HMAC-SHA256 scheme as /api/v2/integration/init. Concatenate the field values below in the order listed (excluding token and signature), HMAC-SHA256 them with your integration's hash_token, and base64-encode the result into signature. Omitted optional fields contribute an empty string.

